    <div class="sub-title">Additional Manual Verifications & Screenshot Placeholders:</div>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Normal Termination Scenario:</strong> A worker process ran for its designated lifespan and exited cleanly with <code>exit(0)</code>. The watchdog detected normal termination via <code>WIFEXITED</code> and refrained from restarting it.</li>
    </ul>
    
